      "writtenOn": "2020-06-29T19:40:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027re currently using clang-scan-deps locally in order to figure out what to send to RBE for C++ files. Tools like Bazel require specifying all headers in the build graph, so we may end up doing that in the future, as running tools locally eliminates some of the benefits you get from remote builds. (It looks like the rust rules for Bazel require listing all source files)",
      "parentUuid": "47e72e3f_8d9f716a",
      "revId": "3efa86a963d2fa3980902c8dbe53af1840b57418",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
